        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mul-T-Lock Hercular Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith its truly unique design the MUL-T-LOCK Hercular deadbolt is truly spectacular high security lock. The Hercular is reinforced in just about every way possible. From a UL437 Listed Cylinder, to strong latch, to Bolt Bearing Mechanism, the Hercular Deadbolt will stop almost any attempt at forced entry. Strength usually does not mix with Flexibility. Not in the case of the Hercular, since it is the only Grade 1 Deadbolt with an adjustable backset. The Hercular deadbolt is true <b>high security lock</b> that exceeds all high security standards.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Single Cylinder (Key on outside and Thumb Turn inside) Deadbolt and is available in 7 different finishes. Supplied with two (2) keys and owner key card. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/grade-1-mul-t-lock-hercular-double-cylinder-deadbolt\"><b>Hercular Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/grade-1-mul-t-lock-hercular-double-cylinder-captive-key-deadbolt\"><b>Hercular Double Cylinder Captive Key Deadbolt</b></a> Please see our guide on <a href=\"/pages/how-to-choose-the-best-deadbolt\">how to choose the best deadbolt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMUL-T-LOCK's deadbolts are designed to provide superior door protection with uncompromised key control. The Key Card owner is the only person allowed to have the keys duplicated. Remove the worry about anyone making duplicates of your keys. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features </b> for Mul-T-Lock Hercular Single Cylinder Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 1 Locking Mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Bump Proof Lock Design</li>\r\n<li>Mul-T-Lock 206SP Security Keyway</li>\r\n<li>2 Keys per Lock</li>\r\n<li>UL Fire Rated Latch</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset fits 2-3/8\" and  2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>UL437 Drill and Pick Resistance Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Door frame strike reinforced with 3\" screws for extra security</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n<li>MUL-T-LOCK's Patented Interactive Key Control System</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFits 1-1/2\" to 2\" thick doors. If your door is 1-3/8\" thick you must add an Extension Ring below. For doors 2-1/16\" to 3-1/4\" thick you must add a Thick Door Kit below.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Grade 1 Mul-T-Lock Hercular Single Cylinder Deadbolt",
                "description": "Mul-T-Lock Hercular Single Cylinder Deadbolts. High Security Grade 1 restricted key deadbolts. Single cylinder (key on outside and thumb turn on inside) with adjustable backset. Available in 7 different finishes.  The Mul-T-Lock Hercular deadbolt is true high security lock that exceeds all high security standards.\r\n",
                "keywords": "MTL-206S-HD1 Bump Proof Single Cylinder Deadbolts,  KW-HD1 Mul-T-Lock Hercular Single Cylinder Deadbolts, Mul-T-Lock Deadbolts, Security locks, Grade 1 locks, commercial deadbolts, Mul-T-Lock Hercular deadbolts, pick proof locks, High Security Single Cylinder Deadbolts, Mul-T-Lock restricted keyway, Mul-T-Lock restricted keys,"
            },
